M4.20 unittest discovery diagnosis
Date: 2026-08-28

Error image
-----------
`python3 -m unittest discover -v` exited successfully but reported zero tests,
so it did not provide the intended complete Control regression evidence.

Cause
-----
The repository's tests directory is not configured as a discovery package.
The versioned GitHub workflow invokes all six test modules explicitly. This is
existing repository behavior, not a test failure and not a server condition.

Risk
----
Treating the zero-test invocation as a full pass would create false-green
evidence. No remote or server state was changed.

Rollback
--------
No server rollback is required. Repository rollback remains abandonment or
revert of the M4.20 branch.

Approved continuation
---------------------
Invoke the same six existing modules and the new M4.20 module explicitly, as
the GitHub workflow does, and record only that nonzero test run as full Control
validation evidence.
